{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33755","headline":"正乐府十篇 贪官怨 · 皮日休","name":"正乐府十篇 贪官怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"国家省闼吏，赏之皆与位。\n素来不知书，岂能精吏理。\n大者或宰邑，小者皆尉史。\n愚者皆混沌，毒者如雄虺。\n伤哉尧舜民，肉袒受鞭箠。\n吾闻古圣王，天下无遗士。\n朝庭及下邑，治者皆仁义。\n国家选贤良，定制兼拘忌。\n所以用此徒，令之充禄仕。\n何不广取人，何不广历试？\n下位既贤哉，上位何如矣。\n胥徒赏以财，俊造悉爲吏。\n天下若不平，吾当甘弃市。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}